{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Forces: air resistance, water resistance and friction","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f4","foreground":"#1f2d1f","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Friction"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A force that slows down moving things when two surfaces rub against each other."}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1-b","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1b-t","content":"Air resistance"},{"type":"text","id":"c1b-e","content":"A force that pushes against things moving through the air, slowing them down."}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What force slows a sledge sliding down a hill?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Friction","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Magnetism","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which force acts on a swimmer moving through water?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Gravity pulling them down","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Water resistance","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Static electricity","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"You roll a ball along a wooden floor and a carpet. Which way do you go to test friction?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Roll it on the wooden floor first","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4-x"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Roll it on the carpet first","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4-y"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4-x","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4x-t","content":"The ball rolls a long way on the smooth wood. Less friction means it keeps going."},{"type":"button","id":"c4x-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4-y","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4y-t","content":"The ball stops quickly on the carpet. The rough fibres create more friction."},{"type":"button","id":"c4y-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Does a parachute fall faster or slower than a stone dropped from the same height?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Slower","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Faster","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"What happens to friction when a box is pushed across rough concrete instead of smooth ice?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"It increases","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"It decreases","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-c","label":"It stays the same","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Which shape helps a cyclist move through the air with less air resistance?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"A streamlined shape","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"A flat, wide shape","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"A square box shape","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-h","content":"You finished the forces quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-m","content":"Friction, air resistance and water resistance all slow things down. Well done for learning how they work."}],"actions":[]}}
